// The Appeal, ch8: Counting Jackets. Thursday, May 6 to Thursday, May 20, 2027 (Luis's sixty second birthday call; Federal on Tuesday and Thursday; a call to Gene; the kitchen table; a Wednesday call; the order).
// Coverage per the bible: scenes LR06x3 LR08x2 LR07 LR10 LR17 RC05 RC06 RC13 RC03; quiz LR06x3 LR08x2 LR07 LR10x2 LR17 LR09 LR05 LR18 RC05 RC06 RC13 RC03 RC04 RC01. STAT carries LR06, LR07, LR08 and LR10 here.
// Full-length passage (p2): John Snow's 1854 comparison of the two south London water companies (history of science), written fresh. Short case passage (p1): an excerpt of the People's response, filed Monday, May 3, 2027 (new).
// Facts checked 2026-10-17. Snow, On the Mode of Communication of Cholera, 2nd ed. (1855), read from the archive.org scan b28985266: Table IX, first seven weeks of the 1854 epidemic, Southwark and Vauxhall 40,046 houses, 1,263 deaths, 315 per 10,000 houses; Lambeth 26,107, 98, 37; rest of London 256,423, 1,422, 59; "between eight and nine times"; house counts from a return made to Parliament for 1853; Lambeth moved its works to Thames Ditton in 1852; Southwark and Vauxhall water from Battersea Fields; the two companies' pipes ran down the same streets, customers often without their knowledge; Snow told the supplies apart by the difference in chloride. 2007 World Series Game 3 attendance 49,983 (Wikipedia linescore, citing the Retrosheet box score).
// Law checked 2026-10-17 against C.R.S. 2024 (uncertified printout, leg.colorado.gov, title 18): 18-1-412(6) and (7) (at least thirty five days for the DA to respond; no testing order without a hearing except on the DA's written stipulation, so Meredith stipulates and the court orders on the papers); 18-1-413(1)(a) to (d); 18-1-415 (the Colorado Bureau of Investigation tests unless the court orders otherwise for good cause; the parties confer on methods; the petitioner pays); 18-1-416(2) (results go to CODIS and Colorado and federal databases). Story level only; no section numbers on the page. The thirty five days ran out April 19; Meredith's extra two weeks to May 3 is fiction the statute allows ("a reasonable amount of time, but not less than").
// Weekdays computed 2026-10-17: Wednesday, May 5; Thursday, May 6; Monday, May 3; Tuesday, May 11; Thursday, May 13; Saturday, May 15; Sunday, May 16; Tuesday, May 18; Wednesday, May 19; Thursday, May 20, 2027. Saturday, June 12, 2027 is three weeks from Saturday, May 22. Tuesday, November 6, 2007; Monday, October 29, 2007.
// Reveal schedule: the scrapings were collected in 2007 and never tested (f8s3 to f8s6), and Gene says the cancellation was his (f8s7). Dani tells Ana about her father's neck (f8s6). The jacket count lands at twenty one on the crew list, which fits Ana's ch7 "twenty jackets." The court orders testing on May 20 (closing). The envelope turns over and "Teo" goes under WHO WAS THE KID?; she asks him to drive her, capitalized, and he answers in four seconds. Kept off the page per the bible's calls: the truck's departure minute, the grandmother refrain, the flashlight's end, Teo on the basement stairs. Luis is never called smaller.
// Flags set here: wroteshannon (f8s11). Read here: promisedhim (f8s12), calledgenealiar (f8s7), overclaimed (f8s9), pushedluis (f8s12), pushedteo and wroteshannon (closing).
